This project is a port of the Nx terminal UI. Its layout arithmetic, pinning
state machine, scroll-momentum constants, colour theme, status glyphs and
status-bar wording are derived from the Rust sources under
`packages/nx/src/native/tui/` in the Nx repository (https://github.com/nrwl/nx).

Modules derived from that code carry a header comment naming the upstream file.

